	// | statistics.last_contact_reply_at          | Date (UNIX timestamp)                                                                                                                                  |
	// | statistics.last_admin_reply_at            | Date (UNIX timestamp)                                                                                                                                  |
	// | statistics.last_close_at                  | Date (UNIX timestamp)                                                                                                                                  |
	// | statistics.last_closed_by_id              | String                                                                                                                                                 |
